                            <p class="finalists__text">
                                The SITU Collection transforms water hyacinth into a contemporary furniture material by combining the craftsmanship of local artisans with modern design. Paired with solid teak wood, the material creates furniture that is durable, comfortable, and deeply rooted in Indonesia’s rich craft heritage. Inspired by the Indonesian word situ, meaning “lake,” the collection embraces a user-centered approach while promoting sustainable design that respects both the environment and local traditions.
