                            <p class="finalists__text">
                                The RIPA Collection is inspired by the landscape of Mount Bromo, particularly the vast Sea of Sand, whose ever-changing surface is shaped by the wind. This natural character is expressed through organic forms, lightweight proportions, and textured armrests that subtly echo the ripples of the sand without directly imitating the landscape. Crafted from Sono Keling wood, the collection embodies contemporary furniture that emphasizes ergonomic comfort, honest construction, and a distinctive Indonesian design identity.
