                                The Cosmological Collection translates the values of Indonesian cosmology into contemporary furniture without directly replicating traditional forms. Its design draws inspiration from cultural archetypes such as Plengkung Gading, the Balinese Jineng, the teak tree, and the horseshoe shape, expressed through clean structures, ergonomic proportions, and an honest use of materials. Crafted from solid teak, Lombok ketak weaving, and metal accents, the collection brings together local craftsmanship with a design that is functional, timeless, and well suited to modern living.
